WEBVTT

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:07.690
<i>There are times when it feels like a dream.</i>

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.120
<i>When I was kicked out of the Hero's party,</i>

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.060
<i>I never thought I'd ever 
smile like this again.</i>

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:25.710
<i>To think that these wonderful 
days might continue forever...</i>

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.550
Hey, there.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.510
Been a while, Rein.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.180
Have you been well?

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:47.860
<b>Beast Tamer</b>

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:08.940
Beast Tamer VS Hero

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.530
We'll walk home this way, you two.

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:23.710
Hey, now.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.700
Don't be so cold.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.660
We were comrades once, after all.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:31.370
And we're sorry about what happened.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:34.400
Even if you are useless,

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.630
we could have been gentler with our phrasing.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.760
Rein.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.850
Hey.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.200
You said you were comrades.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.830
Am I to assume you're the Hero's party, then?

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:47.600
I have no business with—

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:51.150
A cat spirit and...

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.270
I-Is that a dragonoid?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.230
What are ultimate species doing here?

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.450
What do you think?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.450
We're Rein's comrades.

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.100
I-Impossible!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.150
Oh, I see...

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:06.660
The talentless Rein has 
chosen to serve you, then?

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.940
Hey, don't you dare!

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:11.870
Rein is our master!

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.460
U-Unbelievable.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:18.380
That piece of trash is 
training ultimate species?

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.760
You came here to ask me something, right?

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:24.110
Yes.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.860
We have an offer you'll find very appealing.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.980
You're aware of the Lost Woods?

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:35.980
Yeah. The preliminary scouting and 
preparation to take them on was my last job.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:39.940
I'm afraid taking them on has proved 
more difficult than anticipated.

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:44.160
As time passes in the Lost Woods, 
the paths change,

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.030
and your destination grows more distant.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.800
They act, as their name 
suggests, like a maze.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:52.680
There's only so much the 
four of us can carry inside,

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:56.640
and we were forced to withdraw 
after just one week.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.760
Therefore, Rein,

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.010
we'd like to ask <i>you</i> 
to help us complete them.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.220
What?!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:06.830
Well, the beasts you can 
tame can easily handle

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:10.180
the forest exploration and 
the transport of materials.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.610
You... really think I'd agree to that?

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:17.270
<i>After you kicked me out 
of the party like that?</i>

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.470
You should be honored to 
contribute to the Hero's party.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.990
Don't you guys agree?

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.420
He might be useless in combat,

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.700
but I guess he has a few uses.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:28.620
Indeed.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.410
Surely even God would acknowledge that.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:34.620
You should be grateful we're giving 
your pathetic self another chance.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:39.130
Rein, you heard the others.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.050
You'll help us, won't you?

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.890
Sorry, but no.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.320
Ask someone else.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.950
Sorry for the wait, you two.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.150
It's not nice to keep 
beautiful girls waiting.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:51.040
I don't mind one bit!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.350
Wait a minute!

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.720
Rein.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.560
What we're doing is essential 
to saving the world.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:03.150
Deep in the Lost Woods lies one of the noble 
relics needed to defeat the Demon King,

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.990
the Shield of Truth.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.400
Noble relics?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:07.950
Is there really...

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.470
Oh, right. We forgot to pass that on.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:15.160
If we can't acquire the noble relics, 
we won't be able to defeat the Demon King,

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.360
and monsters will run rampant over the world.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.360
The powerful will be able 
to stand against them then,

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:24.340
but what of the ordinary 
people in the cities?

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.010
<i>If monsters run rampant over the world...</i>

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:33.780
<i>The same fate</i>

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.900
<i>might befall somewhere else...</i>

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.430
<i>But...</i>

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.580
Fine. I'll do it.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.170
You should've agreed from the start.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.130
Why does that dummy take 
so long with everything?

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.640
For pity's sake.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:10.470
You've wasted our valuable time.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:14.680
Now, let's head elsewhere and 
discuss the particulars—

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.200
Wait just one minute!

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.850
Can I help you?

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.400
I'd like to argue,

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:26.610
but if Rein wants to do this, 
I have to let him.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:27.990
But first...

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.490
Apologize properly to Rein!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.060
What a strange thing to say.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.240
I believe I did apologize, didn't I?

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.920
That wasn't a real apology!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:44.510
The fact of the matter is, you fired the man,

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.890
and now you're asking him to do you a favor.

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:50.060
I believe such acts call for 
a more appropriate demeanor.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.300
In other words...

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.300
Grovel, if you please.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:57.960
What's the problem?

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.980
Given how annoying you are, I'd much 
prefer to fry you with my Breath.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:06.690
But I know my master would 
be angry if I went that far.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.650
So if you'll just press those empty 
heads of yours to the ground and beg,

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:12.610
I might be willing to spare you.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.130
Did you say "grovel"?

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.340
You expect <i>me</i> to...

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.460
Don't be stupid!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.520
<i>Me</i>, the Hero, Arios?

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:25.070
You expect me to grovel 
to that incompetent man?

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.920
I refuse to do anything so foolish!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.100
He's right.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.010
We haven't done anything wrong!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:34.220
I, the great Leane, 
would never be caught groveling!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.180
It is indeed an unpleasant proposition.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.640
Hey, Rein!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.010
You're a negligent master!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:43.100
You need to keep your pets on a tighter leash!

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:44.830
Pets?

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.320
Yeah, pets!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.170
I think spending too much time with 
non-humans has made you crazy.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.260
Even if they're ultimate species, 
they're still not human!

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:58.400
What's wrong with referring to 
human-looking <i>animals</i> as pets?!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.580
Though, I'll admit they're good-looking...

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:08.120
Admit it. You're keeping 
them as pets, not comrades.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:12.940
I get it now!

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:15.320
He's hot for animals!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.320
Makes sense for a beast—

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:30.430
D-Damn you... Rein...

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:32.650
You hit <i>me</i>?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.740
A pathetic beast tamer

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.450
struck <i>me</i>, the Hero?!

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:40.320
I'll do it again and again.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:43.000
Kanade and Tania are my precious comrades.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.560
Make a mockery of them,

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:47.580
and pay the price!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.580
Pay the price, eh?

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:50.800
Very well...

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:54.720
Then why don't we make things 
clear once and for all?

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:01.260
My party and your "comrades"...

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.320
Which is stronger?

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.120
Right.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:26.620
Fight!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.000
So I'm up against you?

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:32.920
Perfect.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.970
I've been hoping to cross blades 
with an ultimate species lately.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:46.140
I'm gonna beat you black and blue 
and make you say sorry to Rein!

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.670
There's no reason I should 
ever apologize to him.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:52.000
The Hero's party has no need for weaklings.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.230
Oh, really?

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.150
Then... you'd better get ready!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:58.740
She's fast!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.440
There's more where that came from!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.660
<i>This woman...</i>

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:10.250
<i>She's not just fast. 
Every single blow hits like a hammer!</i>

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:12.880
<i>She's going to force me back!</i>

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.920
What, not gonna strike back?

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.260
I guess the Hero's party 
isn't as great as they say!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.470
Don't mock me...

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.180
you brat!

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.220
Take this!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.640
Secret technique! 
Hellfire and Brimstone Slash!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.920
<i>She deflected it?!</i>

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.410
<i>That strike can pulverize steel,</i>

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:37.190
<i>yet she just batted it away like a fly...</i>

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:39.580
What a silly guy.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.860
You talked like it was 
some big, bad technique,

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.400
so I thought it would be serious,

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.020
but I barely felt it.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.060
What a let-down!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.110
Since we need Rein's help,

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:53.830
I was holding off on killing you, but...

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:58.160
Sorry, but I'm about to 
show you all I've got.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.010
Don't blame me if you die!

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.920
All you've got, huh?

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:04.650
Then, I guess I'll...

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.680
Unleash about half of what I've got, maybe?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:11.720
<i>Wh-What?!</i>

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.830
After all, if you're gonna go all-out,

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:19.850
I guess I ought to care a <i>little</i>...

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:24.620
So... if you get hurt, 
it's nothing personal, okay?

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:29.630
<i>She hasn't even been using 
half of her strength?</i>

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:31.070
<i>It can't be true...</i>

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.570
<i>It's impossible!</i>

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:36.600
<i>And yet... if it's true...</i>

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:40.560
<i>No matter what I do, 
there's no way I can win!</i>

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:42.080
Here I go!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.000
Why?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.600
Why is someone so strong

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:49.730
serving that pathetic, little weakling?!

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.190
Isn't that obvious?

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:56.980
Because Rein is way, 
way stronger than you guys!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.780
D-Don't—

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:15.080
I guess I overdid it a little!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.350
No, it's okay!

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:19.920
I mean, the way he made fun 
of Rein made me seriously mad!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.420
How about you learn better, okay?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:28.240
Oh? So I'll be fighting you two, will I?

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:30.510
I would have preferred to fight that Hero,

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:33.240
but I'll let Rein snatch the glory there.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.390
You might want to watch 
that attitude of yours.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:37.960
How dare you speak of Arios that way?!

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:42.270
It's just that you two seem so easily beaten!

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.080
This wretched, little lizard...

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:46.520
You'll be regretting those words soon enough.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:48.340
We'll see about that.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:53.280
Now behold my thousand-spell repertoire!

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:55.330
Feel the gravity of a star in your body!

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.750
Gather, cleansing light.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.510
Gravity Burst!

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.510
Holy Flare!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.510
Our spells disappeared?!

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:17.060
You two! If only you could 
see the looks on your faces!

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:18.860
How amusing!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.450
I thought you were going to try to beat me!

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:23.580
Mina, let's work together again!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.250
Right!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.800
<i>There must be some cheap trick behind it.</i>

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.960
<i>Dragonoid or whatever she is,</i>

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:32.370
<i>the same trick won't work on me twice!</i>

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.440
Red Crimson!

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.740
Judgment Arrow!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.460
It'll turn out the same way each time.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.810
A-Again?

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:43.710
How...

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.930
What did you do?!

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.980
Material Canceler.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.600
It analyzes a spell at the fundamental level

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.880
and hits it with an appropriate 
wave of magic to cancel it out.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.230
In other words,

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:02.230
your spells can't possibly work on me.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.240
This is ridiculous!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.950
How dare a mere lizard look 
down on humans like us?!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:09.660
The Hero's party fears nothing!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.610
It has the protection of God!

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.540
Dragoon Howling!

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.620
Whiteout!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.560
Ignito Javelin!

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.920
Icicle Lance!

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.090
Gale Storm!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.920
Wind Cutter!

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.920
I am... the ultimate mage...

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:33.630
with a thousand spells!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.130
Foolish one.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:37.100
Bow before the power of God!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.760
Thousand spells? Power of God?

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.060
How ridiculous.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.200
Rein, you know, will tame 
ten thousand beasts...

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:49.000
And some day, he may even tame God.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.040
Wisdom of black and white, devour all!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.580
Double Disaster!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.780
Flame, burn and burst!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.710
Fireball!

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:04.800
Goodness gracious.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.040
Lost your nerve at last?

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:10.960
I'm no fan of stomping on the weak myself...

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.220
But I'm afraid...

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.560
You seem to be under the 
impression you can get away

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:19.180
with mocking my master without consequence.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.680
As a special gift, I'll show you true magic.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.550
Not that pitiful advanced magic,

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.610
but the next level up, epic magic.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.480
You have earned the wrath of God.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.080
Such sins are eternal.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:39.300
Let the power of heaven 
crush your very souls.

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:38.740
Wh-What's going on?

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:41.040
What is she doing?

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.950
M-Mina... look up!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.210
How in the world do we...

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:54.180
I offer you this fine demise.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.630
Ultimate End.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:04.090
Kindly accept it.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:09.150
L-Leane! Fight back! Take her down!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.240
L-Like hell I can!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.280
You do it!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.960
I can't do it, either!

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.060
I a-a-apologize!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:15.390
Please, forgive us!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.450
Oh, God! Please, God!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.120
Ba-boom!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.140
Aw, I was just kiddin'!

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.250
Gracious, try to have some dignity.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.460
You shouldn't take a mere bluff so seriously.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:34.320
Or perhaps I'll do it for real?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:38.080
No, I don't want to upset Rein.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.620
You should celebrate your good fortune!

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:47.900
It was foolish for you to turn on the Hero.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.200
Rein.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:55.600
Not only did you slap away my merciful 
offer to make use of a useless beast tamer,

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.980
you're actually turning on me?

00:16:57.980 --> 00:16:59.080
I'll see to it that—

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.400
Damn you!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.870
I was talking there!

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:06.830
And I don't want to hear any of it.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.880
Is that so?

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.840
In that case...

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.210
I'll put an end to this!

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:15.930
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:20.100
<i>Every time I dodge, he changes his 
blade's arc to drive me further back...</i>

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.810
<i>Facing him as an enemy, 
I'm forced to realize it anew...</i>

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:26.640
<i>The Hero's swordplay is truly impressive!</i>

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:29.790
What's wrong with you now?!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:35.230
You can't put a scratch on 
me if you keep running away!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:36.920
<i>The chosen Hero...</i>

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.080
<i>He should be an unspeakably powerful foe...</i>

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.240
<i>Why, then?</i>

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:45.290
<i>Why do I feel none of the desperation 
I felt when I faced Tania?</i>

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.140
<i>He's the Hero, but...</i>

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.380
Is this all you've got?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.220
He blocked my a—

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.880
<i>Where did he get this inhuman strength?!</i>

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.430
<i>A mere beast tamer shouldn't be able to—</i>

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.560
<i>It's not just strength!</i>

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.520
<i>He never moved like this before!</i>

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.110
<i>How?</i>

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.270
How can you do that?!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:15.240
You want to know?

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:19.950
This is all the power of the beast 
tamer that you previously mocked.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:24.570
The strength of my attacks were earned 
through my contract with Kanade.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:27.690
And the reason your attacks can't hit me

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:32.220
is because of the training I did as 
a beast tamer to study my targets.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.170
Since this battle began...

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:39.630
No, since long ago, 
I've been watching you fight.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.610
How many steps you take before you swing,

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:43.350
the turn of your gaze 
when going for a feint...

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.350
Be quiet!

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.120
I already know your attack 
patterns to some degree.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.380
And my own strikes

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.230
are backed by the power of a cat spirit!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.570
There's no way you can win in a fair fight.

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.180
Admit defeat, Arios.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.790
You really are stupid!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.410
Have you forgotten?

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.080
I have the Hero's special magic!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.750
I'll fry you to charcoal, 
you useless beast tamer!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.350
Fireball!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.620
Giga Volt!

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.980
You don't have the power to—

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:27.100
Mere novice magic canceled 
out my lightning magic?!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:30.430
<i>A Fireball backed by Tania's magic power</i>

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:32.270
<i>is a match for even advanced magic!</i>

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.480
I don't know what little 
trick you used there,

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.000
but it won't change my advantage!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:42.440
I believe Fireball and Heal are 
the only spells at your disposal.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.590
I might not be Leane's equal...

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:47.560
But I still have a variety 
of spells at my disposal!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:55.210
How long can you hold me 
off with that novice magic?

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.040
<i>It certainly would be hard to hold 
him off with just two novice spells.</i>

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:02.050
<i>But the way I really fight is...</i>

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.170
Can you afford to be looking away right now?

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.720
Now, let's end—

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.130
What's going on?

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.600
M-My body's... numb...

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:18.820
I believe I told you once, Arios,

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:22.040
that I can tame insects, as well.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.820
This is an ahrbee.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.570
It's a bee with a paralytic sting.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.160
Wh-When did you...

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.620
I tamed it during a free moment in the fight.

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.680
While moving around, I sent out my thoughts,

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.370
found the creature I wanted,

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.830
and forged a remote temporary contract.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:41.480
How... can this possibly...

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:44.930
You were wrong when you decided 
beast tamers were useless.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:46.950
Now you've lost, Arios.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.940
Now, I'm sorry to say,

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:55.850
but I'm still quite angry over 
how you mocked Kanade and Tania.

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.570
W-Wait, please!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.510
I may have misunderstood a few things,

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:01.640
but... Rein!

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:04.530
We traveled together! We were comrades!

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.700
Weren't we? Well?!

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:09.870
I g-get it!

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:11.720
I give up!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:12.830
Please, forgive me!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:15.080
P-Please, spare me!

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:15.080
Now...

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.540
This ends.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.890
Obviously, if I'd really 
hit you, you'd be dead.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.350
I'll let you off with that.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.730
They say revenge is an empty pursuit,

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:39.040
but boy, do I feel better right now!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.890
Rein!

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.270
Hey!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.990
Kanade! Tania!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:40.020
The Lost Woods

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:39.020
Next Time: "The Lost Woods."
